Hello everyone, there was a pause in our work, I (the programmer) moved to another city. Now everything is fine and we are releasing a small update.

What's new:
- The indication of waves in the survival modes;
- The bosses welcomes the player at the level with a special sounds;
- There are an ambient sounds on the global map;
- Also added a pause between the music

Our bug reporting system does not work well enough (we learned this recently) so in case of problems, please write to us. In the near future we will correct this situation.
The following update will be in normal mode. Thank you for being with us =)

